Commit 276801e46c5d433564f24658bac64f254b7d2d4b

Used, unmodified:
  resources/robots/g1_description/   the 12-DoF G1 model and meshes
  deploy/pre_train/g1/motion.pt       the pretrained walking policy
  deploy/deploy_mujoco/configs/g1.yaml  its control configuration

These files are NOT in this repository. `sim/fetch_assets.sh` downloads them at the
commit above, together with the project's LICENSE, which travels with them into any
image that contains them.

`sim/g1sim/locomotion.py` reimplements the control loop of their
`deploy/deploy_mujoco/deploy_mujoco.py`, and `sim/g1sim/policy.py` evaluates the
policy's LSTM in numpy from the archived weights, so that torch is not required. Neither
copies their source code. The project is not endorsed by Unitree Robotics.
